│    - Actual churn rate: 17.2%                                                │
│    - Flagged rate: 20.4%                                                     │
│    - Recall: 96.3%                                                           │
│  - Married                                                                   │
│    - Customers: 540                                                          │
│    - Actual churn rate: 11.5%                                                │
│    - Flagged rate: 16.9%                                                     │
│    - Recall: 95.2%                                                           │
│  - Single                                                                    │
