│                                                                              │
│  Plainly, the model serves Single customers worse on recall than Divorced    │
│  or Married customers. It also has lower recall for Female customers than    │
│  Male customers. These differences should be monitored before deployment     │
│  and during use.                                                             │
│                                                                              │
│  ## How to use                                                               │
│                                                                              │
│  The saved bundle can be loaded as follows:                                  │
│                                                                              │
│  ```python                                                                   │
│  import joblib                                                               │
│                                                                              │
│  bundle = joblib.load("artifacts/crew2/model.joblib")                        │
│  model = bundle["model"]                                                     │
│  features = bundle["features"]                                               │
│  threshold = bundle["threshold"]                                             │
│  contract_version = bundle["contract_version"]                               │
│  ```                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  New data must pass the dataset contract gate and go through the same        │
│  feature engineering first. After that, score the model using the saved      │
│  feature list and apply the threshold to convert probabilities into flagged  │
│  customers.                                                                  │
│                                                                              │
